{'symbol': 'FIS', 'date': '2021-02-01 08:34:00', 'title': "FIS NAMED TO FORTUNE'S 2021 MOST ADMIRED COMPANY LIST", 'text': "JACKSONVILLE, FLA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY LEADER FIS® (NYSE: FIS) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE FORTUNE MAGAZINE 2021 WORLD'S MOST ADMIRED COMPANY LIST. FIS WAS ONE OF ONLY A SMALL NUMBER OF FINANCIAL TECHNOLOGY PROVIDERS ON THE 2021 FORTUNE LIST. THE FORTUNE SURVEY MEASURES COMPANIES WITH THE STRONGEST REPUTATION WITHIN THEIR INDUSTRIES. FIS RECEIVED HIGH MARKS FOR GLOBAL COMPETITIVENESS, FINANCIAL SOUNDNESS, INNOVATION, QUALITY OF PRODUCTS AND SERVICES, AND USE"}